    "title": "Hexa Puzzle - 2048 Game",
    "description": "Daily Hexa Puzzle is an amazing new puzzle game you'll want to play today and every day! \ud83e\udde9There's no better stress relief than this most relaxing hexa merge game, so slide, connect and merge at least 3 blocks to larger numbers and to infinity.\ud83c\udfc6\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1Highlights:\r\n \u2043 Simple and modern design, user friendly interface, colorful number hexa.\r\n \u2043 Easy to play, slide and connect same blocks to get bigger numbers.\r\n \u2043 Fun and addictive COMBO function, abundant rewards.\r\n \u2043 Relaxing music, dynamic and stimulating sound effects.\r\n \u2043 Multiple beautiful background pictures.\r\n \u2043 Multiple materials of bubbles. Such as: iron, crystal, wood\u2026\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1fHow To Play\uff1f\r\n \u2043 Connect 3 or more same numbers, slide and connect more same numbers to get +1, +2, +3.\r\n \u2043 Slide the number up, down, left, right in any of the eight directions.\r\n\u2043 No Time Limited! \r\n\u2043 Just merge and fun!\r\n\r\nDaily Hexa Puzzle is Suitable for all age and completely FREE to play! Use your wisdom and strategy to merge blocks, enjoy the Daily Hexa Puzzle challenges now!\r\n\r\n\u2764\ufe0fDownload Daily Hexa Puzzle to play the best, free classic hexa puzzle game!",
